        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rya Kihlstedt, Macaulay Culkin, Chris Columbus, John Williams\n- Films and TV series: Home Alone 3, Home Alone series, Dexter, Nashville\n- Roles: Dr. Michelle Ross, Marilyn Rhodes\n\nFacts:\n- Home Alone 3 is the third film in the Home Alone series.\n- Home Alone 3 was the first Home Alone film not to feature Macaulay Culkin and the cast from the 1990 and 1992 films, director Chris Columbus, or composer John Williams.\n- Rya Kihlstedt is known for co-starring in the 1997 comedy film Home Alone 3.\n- Rya Kihlstedt had a recurring role as Dr. Michelle Ross in the Showtime crime drama Dexter.\n- Rya Kihlstedt had a recurring role as Marilyn Rhodes in the ABC musical drama Nashville.",
